# The identity components are TypeScript and their operations are transpiled into
# this directory, so it is generated. The `exposition.*` components are plain
# JavaScript and nothing generates theirs — those are the source and belong in the
# tree, which a wider rule would silently keep out of it.
components/identity.*/operations/

# the UI build. Kept here rather than in `ui/.gitignore` because npm reads nested ignore
# files when packing, and a rule there would drop it from the tarball.
/ui/dist/
